msgid "Returns the current value and metadata for one specific setting, looked up by option key or human-readable label. Use before updating to confirm a setting exists."
msgstr ""

#: inc/abilities/class-wcar-ability-get-setting.php:39
msgid "Use when you need the current value of one specific setting. If you do not know the exact key or label, call wcar/get-settings first to discover available options. Always call this before wcar/update-setting to confirm the setting exists and record the current value."
msgstr ""

#: inc/abilities/class-wcar-ability-get-setting.php:53
